# Documented Trivy skips (AGENTS.md section 11.3: every skip needs a written
# justification; approval recorded in the PR of the branch that adds it).

# AVD-AWS-0132 (bootstrap state bucket): SSE-S3 provides at-rest encryption;
# a customer-managed KMS key costs ~$1/month against the $1-$5 monthly
# budget, with no benefit for a private single-account state bucket that
# only holds Terraform state.
AVD-AWS-0132

# AVD-AWS-0136 (SNS notifications topic): encrypted with the free AWS-managed
# key (alias/aws/sns); a customer-managed key adds ~$1/month with no
# benefit for a single-account, single-user notification topic.
AVD-AWS-0136
